3 Kasht[D]angal nashtangal vanna[G]lum<BR>   Yordhan[Em] kara''kvin[A]j''ozhuki[D]yalum<BR>   Ea[Bm]liyavin deiv[Em]athal-shathruvinmel<BR>   Jay[A]abheri mu[D]zhakidume;-<slide>
