2 Marthyara[A]rilum njan saha[F#m]yam<BR>   Thellum[E] thedukilla nisch[A]ayam<BR>  Jeva''[D]nathenen''avasyang[E]al''arinju<BR>  Jeeva''nal[D]ellam [E]nadathi[A]dume;-<slide>
3 Ente bha[A]rangal than chu[F#m]malil<BR>  Vechu nj[E]aninnu visr[A]amikum<BR>  Dukav[D]elayilum putug[E]ethangal njan<BR>  Padi''[D]aanadi''c[E]haswas[A]ikum;-<slide>
4 Oru sany[A]ameniketh[F#m]ire<BR>  Varumenn[E]alum njan b[A]ramika<BR>  Thiru[D]''chirakukala[E]laven markumatal-<BR> Oru''do[D]havim e[E]nku v[A]ara;-<slide>
