3 [F] Avanaa''dhyanu anthyan[Bb]ume<BR>    Di[Gm]vya''snehat[C]hin''ura[F]vidame<BR>[C]    Pathinaayirathila[Bb]thi shraesh[F]tanavan<BR>   Sthut[Dm]hyanaam van[C]nyanaam na[F]ayakam;–<slide>
