[G]Kudara''makum bhouma bhavana<BR>[Am]Kudu vittu parannu po[D]kum<BR>[Am]Kaippaniyallatha nithya bhavanam<BR>Kathavoru[D]kkunnu nama[G]kkai;-<slide>
[G]Kunjattin kalyanam aduthuvallo<BR>[Am]Kathirikunna vishudha[D]re<BR>[Am]Karthavin gambera''nadam kelkumpol<BR>Karthanodu''[D]kude pokum [G]njan;-<slide>
