8[G] mrigath[Em]inte vaal[D]inirayaa[G]yorum[F][G][D7][G]<BR>vell[G]a nilayanki dharichu k[Em]ondu[G]<BR>r[D]ajaadhi[Bm] raajanodu[D7]koode va[G]azhum<BR>av[G]arkku sant[Am]hosham (3[G]) u[Em]ndennu[D]mennum<slide>
