[F]Kunjattin kalyana naa[Gm]lil<BR>annu [C7]kshenikappettorellava[F]rum<BR>[F]kandhanodu chernnidu[Gm]van<BR>avar[C7]kannalil bhagyam unda[F]kum<BR>[Am]ivide [Dm]kayari [F]varika [Am]ennu<BR>[F]karthavin [Bb]gembeera [F]nadham ketti[C]dum<slide>
