tube.com/watch?v=bNCjxZIJORU', '1695', '1 Mahtwam mahtwamen preya<BR>Alavillatha danangal nimitham<BR>Jaythodenne oro dinavum<BR>Pularthunna-nin krupakalku sthothram<BR>Sthuthikum inyum ekalavum<BR>Nadathan shaktha''nayavane;-<slide>
