3 Kashtangal anavadiyayi<BR>  Enne''kanu''marakiya daivam<BR>  Rogathil dukathin naduvil<BR>  Sawkyam thannenne jeevippichathinal<BR>  Padum priyane-priyarin<BR>  Naduvil-viduthalin''ganam;-<slide>
