4 [F]Dutharkum kud[Am]avakasham [F]lebhyamakathulla [Am]reksha<BR>[Gm]Duthariyic[F]hedan bhagyam [F]labhicheni[Gm]ke<BR>[D#]Duthagenam [C]kavalai-than[F]nanu dinam [C7]enikavan<BR>[F]Nuthanamam [C7]duthukalum [A#]unamennye [Dm]nalkidunnu;-<slide>
5 [F]Kashdathayo [Am]pattiniu[F]padravamo [Am]nagnathayo<BR>[Gm]Kashtamettent[F]eshuve-p[F]olakedunn[Gm]enne<BR>[D#]Ottanekam [C]sidhanmaro[F]dothu chernnu [C7]ninnu sthuthi-<BR>[F]charthiduvan [C7]avanenne [A#]yogyanakki[Dm] theerthathorthu;-<slide>
