4 [F]Adhyanum [C]andhyanum [Bb]vandiyanu[Gm]m Aadi''[C]jathanum [F]ennum ana[C7]nnayanum [F]<BR>[F]  Sathyavu[Am]m jeevanu[C7]m margav[Gm]um nithy[C]a pithavu[F]m ennud[Gm]e dhurgavum[F] <BR>[Dm]  Vilicho[Am]n vishwastha[Bb]n vendu[F]m va[A]runnavan[F]e  <slide>
