5 Pari[C]sothanaka[Dm]le thara[Am]nam cheithaka[F]re<BR>   p[C7]arisuthana[C]dhike p[F]arichodu ch[F]eruvan<BR>[F]   shu[Am]thama[F]ka rekthat[Am]halenne sudh[F]a- rekthath[Am]alenne<BR>[Dm]   si[Am]thanakidu[C]kalmavin[F]alenne- divya[C7]-almavin[F]alenne;-<slide>
