4 [D]vin mannum cher[F#m]thedum nam[D]am-japam v[A]innil kod[Em]aadunna n[D]aamam<BR>[Bm]nayam ni[A]dhi paranil [Bm]nyaayam nee[F#m]thikrupaikum<BR>[G]unmayam [A]sakshiyaay [F#m]uyamnu thungk[Em]iya n[D]amam;- yeshu<slide>
