[D]Annutheeru[F#]mente kashta[Bm]m inneemanni[A]le<BR>[A]Annumarum[Em]ente dhukkam[A7]nichayam th[D]anne<BR>[D]Annu thante [Bm]shudharothu [F#]padiarkk[F#m]ume<BR>[A]Ennenikku [Em]sadhyamo mah[A7]al sammelana[D]m;-<slide>
